    - `.\tools\Run-AutomationTests.ps1 --test-glob tests/automation/component_render_tracking_live_spec.lua --no-results`: 4 successes, 0 failures, 0 errors, cleanup confirmed, including bounded mount-diagnostics coverage.
    - `.\tools\Run-AutomationTests.ps1 --project-root tests/framework/command_project --test-glob tests/live/mount_error_recovery_spec.ds.lua --no-results`: 2 expected command errors followed by 2 successful cleanup/diagnostic checks; cleanup confirmed.
    - `.\tools\Run-AutomationTests.ps1 --test-glob tests/automation/scheduler_cleanup_live_spec.lua --no-results`: 5 successes, 0 failures, 0 errors, cleanup confirmed.
